                    "cotester_chat_messages": [
                        {
                            "id": "313",
                            "tc_id": "201",
                            "thread_id": "",
                            "user_id": "11",
                            "message": "As a user, I want to enter details into the form fields, verify the Done and Clear actions, and interact with radio button controls.\n\n\nPart 1: Enter User Information\nSteps:\n\n\nWait for the visibility of the Full Name field.\nType “DemoFull” in the Full Name field.\nWait for 2 seconds.\nType “DemoFirst” in the First Name field.\n\n\nPart 2: Validate Form Actions\nSteps:\n\n\nWait for the visibility of Done keyboard button\nTap on Done button of keyboard.\nWait for the visibility of the Clear button.\nTap on the Clear button.\n\n\nPart 3: Navigate to Controls\nSteps:\n\n\nTap on the Controls tab.\nWait for the visibility of the Male option.\nTap on the Female radio button.\n\n\nPart 4: Open Modal Sheet and Navigate to Detail Screen\nSteps:\n\n\nTap on the Screens tab.\nWait for the visibility of Open Modal Sheet.\nTap on Open Modal Sheet.\nWait for the visibility of the Close button.\nSwipe down on the screen to dismiss the modal sheet.\n\n\nPart 5: Navigate Through Nested Screen and Return\n\n\nWait for the visibility of Open Detail Screen.\nWait for 2 seconds.\nTap on Open Detail Screen.\n\n\nPart 6: Navigate Through Nested Screen and Return\nSteps:\n\n\nWait for the visibility of “Push Another Screen” button.\nTap on “Push Another Screen” button.\nWait for the visibility of “Nested Detail” screen.\nTap on the Back navigation button.\nWait for the visibility of “Detail Screen”.\nTap on Back  navigation button.\nWait for 2 seconds.\n    •        8.    Tap on the Form tab.",
                            "message_type": "sender",
                            "created_at": "2026-11-13 04:36:03",
                            "updated_at": "2026-11-13 04:36:03"
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "314",
                            "tc_id": "201",
                            "thread_id": "",
                            "user_id": "11",
                            "message": "Test Case: 1\n\nTest Case Title: Enter User Information into Form Fields\nModule: User Input Form\nPriority: Medium\n\nPreconditions:\n- The application is launched and is displaying the form with Full Name and First Name fields.\n\nTest Steps:\n1. Wait for the visibility of the Full Name field.\n2. Enter “DemoFull” in the Full Name field.\n3. Wait for 2 seconds.\n4. Enter “DemoFirst” in the First Name field.\n\nExpected Result:\n- The Full Name field contains “DemoFull”.\n- The First Name field contains “DemoFirst”.\n\n---\n\nTest Case: 2\n\nTest Case Title: Validate Done and Clear Form Actions\nModule: User Input Form\nPriority: Medium\n\nPreconditions:\n- The form fields are visible to the user.\n- The keyboard is active.\n\nTest Steps:\n1. Wait for the visibility of the Done keyboard button.\n2. Tap on the Done button of the keyboard.\n3. Wait for the visibility of the Clear button.\n4. Tap on the Clear button.\n\nExpected Result:\n- The keyboard is dismissed after tapping Done.\n- All text fields are cleared after tapping the Clear button.\n\n---\n\nTest Case: 3\n\nTest Case Title: Interact with Radio Button Controls\nModule: User Controls\nPriority: Medium\n\nPreconditions:\n- The form screen is loaded.\n- The Controls tab is visible.\n\nTest Steps:\n1. Tap on the Controls tab.\n2. Wait for the visibility of the Male option.\n3. Tap on the Female radio button.\n\nExpected Result:\n- The Female radio button is selected.\n- The Male radio button is deselected.\n\n---\n\nTest Case: 4\n\nTest Case Title: Open Modal Sheet and Dismiss via Swipe\nModule: Modal Sheet\nPriority: Low\n\nPreconditions:\n- The Screens tab is accessible on the interface.\n\nTest Steps:\n1. Tap on the Screens tab.\n2. Wait for the visibility of Open Modal Sheet.\n3. Tap on Open Modal Sheet.\n4. Wait for the visibility of the Close button on the modal sheet.\n5. Swipe down on the screen to dismiss the modal sheet.\n\nExpected Result:\n- Modal sheet opens upon tapping.\n- Modal sheet is dismissed and returns to previous screen upon swiping down.\n\n---\n\nTest Case: 5\n\nTest Case Title: Navigate to Detail Screen from Modal Sheet Section\nModule: Nested Navigation\nPriority: Medium\n\nPreconditions:\n- The modal sheet has been dismissed and Screens tab is active.\n\nTest Steps:\n1. Wait for the visibility of Open Detail Screen.\n2. Wait for 2 seconds.\n3. Tap on Open Detail Screen.\n\nExpected Result:\n- Detail Screen opens successfully after tapping on Open Detail Screen.\n\n---\n\nTest Case: 6\n\nTest Case Title: Navigate Through Nested Screens and Return to Main Screen\nModule: Nested Navigation\nPriority: Medium\n\nPreconditions:\n- The Detail Screen is currently displayed.\n\nTest Steps:\n1. Wait for the visibility of the “Push Another Screen” button.\n2. Tap on “Push Another Screen” button.\n3. Wait for the visibility of “Nested Detail” screen.\n4. Tap on the Back navigation button.\n5. Wait for the visibility of “Detail Screen”.\n6. Tap on Back navigation button.\n7. Wait for 2 seconds.\n8. Tap on the Form tab.\n\nExpected Result:\n- Nested Detail screen is displayed upon pushing.\n- Navigating back returns to Detail Screen first, then to the main screen.\n- User is returned to the Form tab after navigating back.",
                            "message_type": "replier",
                            "created_at": "2026-11-13 04:36:14",
                            "updated_at": "2026-11-13 04:36:14"
                        }
                    ]
                }
